                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "On relevant data you can right click and 'drill through' to go to the details page which will show the Kaimahi that make up the numbers. From there you can export the data to csv/excel format.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
