                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#f1665a"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " indicates when a leave balance is over 200 hours. This formatting applies to Total Leave (Combined Annual, Long Service and Alternative Holidays), and Annual Leave in isolation.",
